    "Show a dropout metric history with separate loss and accuracy scales.",
    "How can dropout validation loss keep falling after accuracy stops changing?",
    "Explain loss accuracy traces with the same recorded epochs.",
    "Check a dropout prediction that loses less while remaining correct."
